# Hub metadata boxes (LOCKED)

Reference: **vBlog aside “On-chain metadata”** and **dApps Metadata** tab boxes.

## Single implementation

- Component: `HubMetadataStatCard` / `HubMetadataStatGrid` in `src/components/hub/HubMetadataStatGrid.tsx`
- Tokens alias only: `TokenStatCard` must wrap `HubMetadataStatCard` (no local chrome)
- Tokens: `src/lib/hub/shellTokens.ts` (`KX_METADATA_STAT_*`, `metadataStatGridClassForCount`)

## Locked look (do not fork)

| Piece | Token / class |
|-------|----------------|
| Surface | `KX_SURFACE_NESTED` |
| Card | `KX_METADATA_STAT_CARD` (`kx-metadata-stat-card` + nest; hover border via globals.css → `--hub-accent`) |
| Label | `KX_METADATA_STAT_LABEL` |
| Value | `KX_METADATA_STAT_VALUE` / `_ACCENT` / `_MUTED` / `_LINK` |
| Grid | Prefer **smart pack** (default on `HubMetadataStatGrid`): 2 cols; long ids/txs/addresses `sm:col-span-2`. Count helper: 1→1, 2/4→2 cols, 3→3, 5+→up to 3 only when all values are short and pack evenly. **Never leave an empty third column for 2 items; never full-width leftover for 4.** |
| Stack / smart pack | Default `smartPack` on. Long **values or hints** span full width. Put long explanations in `tooltipTitle` + `tooltipDescription`, not tall `hint` lines that break the grid. |
| Tooltips | On the **whole card** via `tooltipTitle` + `tooltipDescription`. **No** inline `?` icons. Never pass height classes (`h-full`) into `Tooltip` `className` (that styles the portal surface). |
| Section titles (token / game overview body) | `GameOverviewTitleBlock` with `as="h3"`: locked tilt (`h-4`), `kx-page-kicker`, `GAME_OVERVIEW_H3`, bottom divider. `compact` is **margin only**. |
| Datetime presets | `CovenantDatetimeField`: chips **inline** with the input (same row height), not stacked below. |

## Smart packing (required)

1. Omit empty values (grid already filters blanks).
2. Omit admin/ops values (see `hub-no-admin-ops-public.mdc`).
3. If `dApp ID` equals `Slug`, show **Slug** only (drop redundant id).
4. Short pairs stay 2-up; long mono ids/addresses get their own row.
5. Do not force `lg:grid-cols-3` when that leaves a lonely orphan beside empty space.

## Section titles

Chronicles / Hub standard: **white / zinc-100 titles**, accent only on tilt bar + kickers. Do not paint section titles with `--hub-accent-light`.

## Forbidden

- Local `rounded-* border bg-*` for the same job
- Hardcoded cyan/blue (`#02abb8`, `bg-blue-*`) instead of `--hub-accent*`
- Forcing `lg:grid-cols-3` when only 1–2 boxes exist in a panel
- Full-width span leftovers that create empty panel space
- Tall multi-line hints that make one short-value card dominate the row (use tooltips)
